{"schema_version":1,"pipeline_version":"v6","run_id":"data-analysis-2026-04-01-20260401035451.-d8d478ad","generated_at":"2026-04-01T03:54:51.018Z","canonical_id":"huggingface:Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B","promptHash":"sha256:96fe75dbbf52a0c97d7580681b6906af35b040643b5094adbbf4ff9b8de0f9b0","summary_version":1,"status":"qualified","source":"huggingface","name":"Qwen3.5-4B","url":"https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B","tags":["transformers","safetensors","qwen3_5","image-text-to-text","conversational","base_model:Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B-Base","base_model:finetune:Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B-Base","license:apache-2.0","eval-results","endpoints_compatible","deploy:azure","region:us"],"stats":{"downloads_total":2606564,"likes_total":423},"metadata":{"license":"N/A","lang":"N/A","categories":{"capabilities":[],"scenes":[],"lifecycle":[]}},"summary_short":{"zh":"Qwen3.5-4B是一个拥有40亿参数的多模态语言模型，能够同时处理文本和图像输入并生成连贯的文本回复，解决了传统语言模型缺乏视觉理解能力的问题。其技术核心在于采用统一的Transformer架构，将图像特征与文本表示深度融合，实现了跨模态信息的有效对齐与推理。开发者可利用该模型构建视觉问答系统、带图像审核的聊天机器人，或开发教育工具中图文结合的交互应用，通过Hugging Face平台轻松进行微调和部署，为多模态AI应用提供灵活的基础能力。","en":"Qwen3.5-4B is a 4-billion-parameter multimodal language model that excels at understanding and generating text from both textual and visual inputs, making AI conversations more context-aware and versatile. Its key innovation lies in effectively integrating image understanding wi…","es":"Qwen3.5-4B is a 4-billion-parameter multimodal language model that excels at understanding and generating text from both textual and visual inputs, making AI conversations more context-aware and versatile. Its key innovation lies in effectively integrating image understanding wi…"},"summaries":{"en":"Qwen3.5-4B is a 4-billion-parameter multimodal language model that excels at understanding and generating text from both textual and visual inputs, making AI conversations more context-aware and versatile. Its key innovation lies in effectively integrating image understanding with language processing through a unified transformer architecture, enabling coherent responses grounded in visual context. Developers can fine-tune it for applications like visual question answering, content moderation with image context, or building interactive assistants that reference uploaded images, using the Hugging Face ecosystem for deployment.","zh":"Qwen3.5-4B是一个拥有40亿参数的多模态语言模型，能够同时处理文本和图像输入并生成连贯的文本回复，解决了传统语言模型缺乏视觉理解能力的问题。其技术核心在于采用统一的Transformer架构，将图像特征与文本表示深度融合，实现了跨模态信息的有效对齐与推理。开发者可利用该模型构建视觉问答系统、带图像审核的聊天机器人，或开发教育工具中图文结合的交互应用，通过Hugging Face平台轻松进行微调和部署，为多模态AI应用提供灵活的基础能力。","es":"Qwen3.5-4B is a 4-billion-parameter multimodal language model that excels at understanding and generating text from both textual and visual inputs, making AI conversations more context-aware and versatile. Its key innovation lies in effectively integrating image understanding with language processing through a unified transformer architecture, enabling coherent responses grounded in visual context. Developers can fine-tune it for applications like visual question answering, content moderation with image context, or building interactive assistants that reference uploaded images, using the Hugging Face ecosystem for deployment."},"provider":{"name":"deepseek-tri","version":"1.0.0","mode":"json_single"},"quality":{"score":0.92,"fallback":false,"length":{"en":633,"zh":224,"es":633},"warnings":["es_short:0"],"accepted_at":"2026-04-01T03:49:46.863Z"}}
